WEBVTT

00:03:59.665 --> 00:04:01.210
feeding them,

00:04:01.234 --> 00:04:02.661
helping them to the bathroom,

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:04.679
helping them move about.

00:04:05.356 --> 00:04:08.967
They also provide a significant
level of medical care,

00:04:08.991 --> 00:04:13.938
because they often know a lot about
their loved one's condition and needs,

00:04:13.962 --> 00:04:16.851
sometimes better
than the patients themselves,

00:04:16.875 --> 00:04:20.453
who may be paralyzed
or confused by their diagnosis.

00:04:21.284 --> 00:04:22.834
In those situations,

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:27.031
carers are also advocates for the patient.

00:04:28.769 --> 00:04:30.966
Also of critical importance